Source: dct-os-desktop
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: DCT IT Services <it@dct.edu.ph>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: dct-os-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: dct-os-defaults (>= 1.0),
         papirus-icon-theme,
         fonts-inter,
         fonts-jetbrains-mono,
         libreoffice-writer,
         libreoffice-calc,
         libreoffice-impress,
         libreoffice-gnome,
         firefox,
         nautilus,
         evince,
         timeshift,
         epoptes-client
Recommends: onlyoffice-desktopeditors,
            winetricks,
            calamares,
            gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
# NOTE: GNOME extension package names drift between Ubuntu releases. Verify with
#   apt-cache search gnome-shell-extension
# on 24.04 before promoting any of these from Recommends to Depends. A wrong
# name in Depends makes the whole metapackage uninstallable.
Suggests: winehq-stable
Description: DCT OS desktop environment
 Meta package that turns an Ubuntu 24.04 LTS base into the standard DCT OS
 classroom desktop: the college's application set, icon/theme baseline and
 classroom management tooling, in one installable unit.
 .
 This is an internally deployed institutional image, not a public
 distribution.
